title: AltarItemPlacedGeneral
---
<<declare $altarPlaceLine = 0>>
<<set $altarPlaceLine = random_range(0, 2)>>

<<if $altarPlaceLine == 0>>
One step closer, my love. Just hold on. #line:OneStep
<<elseif $altarPlaceLine == 1>>
It’s warm… like hope. #line:ItsWarm
<<else>>
The light cuts through the mist. I can see it again. #line:TheLight
<<endif>>
===
